Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 07:13:29 +0200
Subject: fix(d3d11): enforce producer-authoritative readonly ABI v2

Consumer mappings are read-only and all registration state is derived from the producer-owned pipe PID and a revalidated session. Mixed ABI clients fail closed before any handle duplication; CPU fallback remains unchanged.

Agent-Role: forge

Agent-Thread: 01a06821-2c9c-7ab3-b107-96fe0178b65a

Work-Unit: forge-254-f02-helper-20260904

Issue: 254

ADR-Revision: amendment-2-draft-f02-helper-cpu-readonly-20260904

Evidence: producer-authenticated PID/session; consumer FILE_MAP_READ
